count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"How Steep is your Dust? Direct Measurements of Nebular Attenuation Curves at Cosmic Noon with JWST","authors":["Gabriel Maheson","Sirio Belli","Sandro Tacchella","Letizia Bugiani","Joel Leja","Rebecca Davies","Minjung Park","Amir H. Khoram","Matteo Sapori","Caterina Liboni","Benjamin P. Collins"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"利用Blue Jay巡天的24个宇宙正午恒星形成星系深JWST/NIRSpec光谱，直接测量星云尘埃衰减曲线，发现其形状多样性小、总体接近Calzetti曲线，但星族与星云红化的差异随恒星质量增加且与倾角无关，并揭示该曲线选择会对强线金属丰度测量造成最高5σ的系统偏差。","date":"2026-10-27","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.33166","score":58,"stars":3,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2610.41584","canonical_id":"2610.41584","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Co-evolution of AGN and Host Galaxies across Cosmic Time Using JWST data","authors":["Priyanka Jalan","Tomotsugu Goto","Tetsuya Hashimoto","Angel Rodriguez Barbosa","Chih-Teng Ling","Ece Kilerci","Terry Long Phan","Srivardini Ayyappan"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"基于SMILES与JADES交叉匹配的2,709个源的JWST多波段星表（0.05<z<6），用Pearson相关矩阵与主成分分析发现星系多样性由\"AGN与星系活动\"和\"恒星年龄\"两个主成分主导；AGN光度主要由宿主星系当前冷气体供给驱动，近期恒星形成是其主要观测示踪。","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.41584","score":48,"stars":2,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"galaxy gas","points":10}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Multi-phase and Molecular Gas","Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2610.37646","canonical_id":"2610.37646","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Measuring the magnetization profiles of galaxy groups and clusters","authors":["Kritti Sharma","Vikram Ravi","Elisabeth Krause"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA","astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"We combine SPICE-RACS Faraday rotation measure stacks around DESI groups and ROSAT clusters with electron optical-depth profiles constrained by FRB dispersion measures and the kSZ effect, placing 95% upper limits of <3.9-11.6 μG (<2.3-6.4 μG) on the